 with my family for saying boys will be boys and not making it a big deal!!\\nI caught my nephew- I was angry! with him and my sister!!! my daughter wasnt curious...\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-08-07T02:42:25.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 549,\n        \"replyCount\": 6,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"princess81600\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Emily and Twix♡\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-avt-0068-tx2/cf165d9eb6bd0e05e83b4899098b8885~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=f30e5665&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=8c8WYpDrLcSdhXcAI2xOO3LGV3E%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast5\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"6816814187819648006\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAApWzMuduhAClyq8h19hbi0UmrC2SEcRll1Y4tZra30QrpYv5C5yFtnCt6m7H76qLR\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7668553651220464414\",\n        \"text\": \"100% “playing doctor”. Uhm no\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-31T05:05:07.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 11,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"mommasmith1994\",\n          \"displayName\": \"MommaSmith🫶\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-avt-0068-tx2/3c43761f1bc68293c045278f06a9a19c~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=3282fbaa&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=Wn28NSEoymgf1xTNEqcxTu75rjQ%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast5\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"6993753606063457286\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAASk673IHVuZ4JCzutX5EnBeU8Bqk5pTU6o-n5bc5q3xbP9Caw4MsBoITUT5hHrpqd\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7490661573838275371\",\n        \"text\": \"As a child the only one who ever spoke to me about this was my grandmother. I’m thankful she braved the uncomfortable conversations bc then I knew